{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moth is a first person thriller where you play as a police investigator searching the underground parking hall for a murderer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you descend deeper underground, you find out that absolutely nothing is what it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What has really happened? What is the true crime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way out of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625420/extras/screenshot.jpg?t=1744660983\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIQUE ENVIRONMENT: </strong>search the underground parking hall with six levels for clues. Every level brings a twist to the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO SAVE GAME:</strong> you have to play until the end. About 1 hour of gameplay without any save games, to really capture the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IMMERSIVE: </strong>Realistic graphics + british voice acting along with minimalistic UI for a  immersive player experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625420?t=1744660983","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625420?t=1744660983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625420/a925982b579322d6942440c3820992485c5a95ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744660983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625420/a925982b579322d6942440c3820992485c5a95ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744660983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains visuals that some individuals may find disturbing."},"detailed_descrip